# Features

Completed feature specifications live here. Each file is one feature, named `<feature-slug>.md`.

A completed spec describes:

- The user-visible behavior.
- The schema changes (with migration IDs).
- The pipeline stages involved.
- The search query pattern it enables.
- The acceptance criteria.

Specs are written when a feature ships, not before. Pre-feature design lives in `docs/architecture/decisions/` and `docs/domain/`.
